# Glossary

Canonical terms for the Member Portal Shell RFC pack. Use these spellings in all related docs.

| Term | Definition |
| ---- | ---------- |
| **Alias route** | Frozen path independent of module id (e.g. `/me/registrations` for module `trips`) |
| **Blueprint phase (BP-N)** | RFC §7 migration phase 0–8 |
| **Builder Migration Contract** | [builder-migration-contract.mdoc](./builder-migration-contract.mdoc) — DL-22 |
| **Cleanup Phase (PS-7 / BP-8)** | Dedicated retirement phase — [cleanup-roadmap.mdoc](./cleanup-roadmap.mdoc) |
| **defaultPrimaryModuleId** | Registry field for portal `/` and bare `/me` redirect target |
| **Dispatcher** | `app/me/[[...modulePath]]/page.tsx` — BP-5+ only |
| **GSH** | `packages/guest-surface-host` — cross-host URL authority |
| **Guest conformance L4** | L3 + required `memberPortal` block (DL-07) |
| **memberPortal** | Workspace manifest block for member module registry |
| **Platform-owned module** | Module id reserved for platform delivery — workspace MUST NOT declare (DL-30) |
| **Portal Shell phase (PS-N)** | Product rollout name — [phase-mapping.mdoc](./phase-mapping.mdoc) |
| **Primary tier** | Bottom nav — max 5 modules (DL-04) |
| **Registration minimal shell** | Brand + back only on `/catalog/*/register` (DL-01) |
| **URL freeze** | Immutable paths — RFC §5.2, WRS addendum §8 |
| **Workspace-owned module** | Declared in `memberPortal` manifest (e.g. `trips`, `wallet`) |

